{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-19-1","title":"Matthew 19:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ heals the sick; 3 answers the Pharisees concerning divorcement; 10 shows when marriage is necessary; 13 receives little children; 16 instructs the young man how to attain eternal life; 20 and how to be perfect; 23 tells his disciples how hard it is for a rich man to enter into the kingdom of God; 27 and promises reward to those that forsake any thing to follow him.</p>\n<p>that when. Mr 10:1; Joh 10:40 he departed.This was our Lord's final departure from Galilee, previous to his crucifixion; but he appears to have taken in a large compass in his journey, and passed through the districts east of Jordan. Some learned men, however, are of opinion, that instead of \"beyond Jordan,\" we should render, \"by the side of Jordan,\" as [peran ,] especially with a genitive, sometimes signifies.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-2","title":"Matthew 19:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>4:23-25; 9:35,36; 12:15; 14:35,36; 15:30,31; Mr 6:55,56</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-3","title":"Matthew 19:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>tempting. 16:1; 22:16-18,35; Mr 10:2; 12:13,15; Lu 11:53,54; Joh 8:6; Heb 3:9 Is it. 5:31,32; Mal 2:14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-4","title":"Matthew 19:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Have. 12:3; 21:6,42; 22:31; Mr 2:25; 12:10,26; Lu 6:3; 10:26 that. Ge 1:27; 5:2; Mal 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-5","title":"Matthew 19:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>said. Ge 2:21-24; Ps 45:10; Mr 10:5-9; Eph 5:31 cleave.[Proskollao ,] \"shall be cemented to his wife,\" as the Hebrew davak implies; a beautiful metaphor, forcibly intimating that nothing but death can separate them.</p>\n<p>Ge 34:3; De 4:4; 10:20; 11:22; 1Sa 18:1; 2Sa 1:26; 1Ki 11:2; Ps 63:8 Ro 12:9 and they. 1Co 6:16; 7:2,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-6","title":"Matthew 19:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>God. Pr 2:17; Mal 2:14; Mr 10:9; Ro 7:2; 1Co 7:10-14; Eph 5:28; Heb 13:4 hath.[Zeugos ,] \"hath yoked together,\" as oxen in the plough, where each must pull equally in order to bring it on. Among the ancients, they put a yoke upon the necks of a new married couple, or chains on their arms, to shew that they were to be one, closely united, and pulling equally together in all the concerns of life.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-7","title":"Matthew 19:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Why. 5:31; De 24:1-4; Isa 50:1; Jer 3:8; Mr 10:4 and to. 1:19; Mal 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-8","title":"Matthew 19:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>because. Ps 95:8; Zec 7:12; Mal 2:13,14; Mr 10:5 suffered. 3:15; 8:31; 1Co 7:6 but. Ge 2:24; 7:7; Jer 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-9","title":"Matthew 19:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Whosoever. 5:32; Mr 10:11,12; Lu 16:18; 1Co 7:10-13,39 except. 2Ch 21:11; Jer 3:8; Eze 16:8,15,29; 1Co 5:1 doth. Ge 12:18,19; 20:3; Jer 3:1; Ro 7:2,3; 1Co 7:4,11,39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-10","title":"Matthew 19:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Ge 2:18; Pr 5:15-19; 18:22; 19:13,14; 21:9,19; 1Co 7:1,2,8,26-28 1Co 7:32-35,39,40; 1Ti 4:3; 5:11-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-11","title":"Matthew 19:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>1Co 7:2,7,9,17,35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-12","title":"Matthew 19:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>which were made. Isa 39:7; 56:3,4 which have. 1Co 7:32-38; 9:5,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-13","title":"Matthew 19:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>brought. 18:2-5; Ge 48:1,9-20; 1Sa 1:24; Ps 115:14,15; Jer 32:39; Mr 10:13 Lu 18:15; Ac 2:39; 1Co 7:14 and the. 16:22; 20:31; Lu 9:49,50,54,55</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-14","title":"Matthew 19:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Suffer. Ge 17:7,8,24-26; 21:4; Jud 13:7; 1Sa 1:11,22,24; 2:18; Mr 10:14 Lu 18:16,17 for. 11:25; 18:3; 1Co 14:20; 1Pe 2:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-15","title":"Matthew 19:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Isa 40:11; Mr 10:16; 1Co 7:14; 2Ti 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-16","title":"Matthew 19:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>one. Mr 10:17; Lu 18:18 what. Lu 10:25; Joh 6:27-29; Ac 16:30 eternal. 25:46; Da 12:2; Joh 3:15; 4:14; 5:39; 6:47,68; 10:28; 12:25; 17:2,3 Ro 2:7; 5:21; 6:22,23; 1Ti 1:16; 6:12,19; Tit 1:2; 3:7; 1Jo 1:2; 2:25 1Jo 5:11-13,20; Jude 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-17","title":"Matthew 19:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>there. 1Sa 2:2; Ps 52:1; 145:7-9; Jas 1:17; 1Jo 4:8-10,16 but. Le 18:5; Eze 20:11,12; Lu 10:26-28; Ro 10:5; Ga 3:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-18","title":"Matthew 19:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Which. Ga 3:10; Jas 2:10,11 Thou shalt do. 5:21-28; Ex 20:12-17; De 5:16-21; Mr 10:19; Lu 18:20; Ro 13:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-19","title":"Matthew 19:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Honour. 15:4-6; Le 19:3; Pr 30:17; Eph 6:1,2 Thou. 22:39; Le 19:18; Lu 10:27; Ro 13:9; Ga 5:14; Jas 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-20","title":"Matthew 19:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>All. Mr 10:20; Lu 15:7,29; 18:11,12,21; Joh 8:7; Ro 3:19-23; 7:9; Ga 3:24 Php 3:6 what. Mr 10:21; Lu 18:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-21","title":"Matthew 19:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>If. 5:19,20,48; Ge 6:9; 17:1; Job 1:1; Ps 37:37; Lu 6:40; Php 3:12-15 go. 6:19,20; Mr 10:21; Lu 12:33; 14:33; 16:9; 18:22; Ac 2:45; 4:32-35 1Ti 6:17-19; Heb 10:34 come. 28; 4:19; 8:22; 9:9; 16:24; Mr 2:14; 8:34; 10:21; Lu 5:27; 9:23; 18:22 Joh 10:27; 12:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-22","title":"Matthew 19:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>he went. 13:22; 14:9; Jud 18:23,24; Da 6:14-17; Mr 6:26; 10:22; Lu 18:23 Joh 19:12-16 for. 6:24; 16:26; Ps 17:14; Eze 33:31; Eph 5:5; Col 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-23","title":"Matthew 19:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>That. 13:22; De 6:10-12; 8:10-18; Job 31:24,25; Ps 49:6,7,16-19; Pr 11:28 Pr 30:8,9; Mr 10:23; Lu 12:15-21; 16:13,14,19-28; 18:24; 1Co 1:26 1Ti 6:9,10; Jas 1:9-11; 2:6; 5:1-4 enter. 5:20; 18:3; 21:31; Joh 3:3,5; Ac 14:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-24","title":"Matthew 19:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>It.So in the Koran, \"The impious, who in his arrogance shall accuse our doctrine of falsity, shall find the gates of heaven shut; nor shall he enter till a camel shall pass through the eye of a needle.\" It was a common mode of expression among the Jews to declare any thing that was rare or difficult.</p>\n<p>26; 23:24; Jer 13:23; Mr 10:24,25; Lu 18:25; Joh 5:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-25","title":"Matthew 19:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Who. 24:22; Mr 13:20; Lu 13:23,24; Ro 10:13; 11:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-26","title":"Matthew 19:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>but. Ge 18:14; Nu 11:23; Job 42:2; Ps 3:8; 62:11; Jer 32:27; Zec 8:6 Mr 10:27; Lu 1:37; 18:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-27","title":"Matthew 19:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>we have forsaken. 4:20-22; 9:9; De 33:9; Mr 1:17-20; 2:14; 10:28; Lu 5:11,27,28; 14:33 Lu 18:28; Php 3:8 what. 20:10-12; Lu 15:29; 1Co 1:29; 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-28","title":"Matthew 19:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>in the regeneration. Isa 65:17; 66:22; Ac 3:21; 2Pe 3:13; Re 21:5 when. 16:27; 25:31; 2Th 1:7-10; Re 20:11-15 ye also. 20:21; Lu 22:28-30; 1Co 6:2,3; 2Ti 2:12; Re 2:26,27; 3:21 the twelve. Ex 15:27; 24:4; 28:21; Le 24:5; Jos 3:12; 1Ki 18:31; Ezr 6:17; Re 7:4 Re 12:1; 21:12-14; 22:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-29","title":"Matthew 19:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>every. 16:25; Mr 10:29,30; Lu 18:29,30; 1Co 2:9 or brethren. 8:21,22; 10:37,38; Lu 14:26; 2Co 5:16; Php 3:8 my. 5:11; 10:22; Lu 6:22; Joh 15:19; Ac 9:16; 1Pe 4:14; 3Jo 1:7 an. 13:8,23 inherit. 16; 25:34,46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-19-30","title":"Matthew 19:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>8:11,12; 20:16; 21:31,32; Mr 10:31; Lu 7:29,30; 13:30; 18:13,14 Ro 5:20,21; 9:30-33; Ga 5:7; Heb 4:1</p>"}]}